Package: r2lambda
Type: Package
Title: Deploy 'R' Scripts as 'AWS Lambda' Functions
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Teofil", "Nakov", , "teofiln@gmail.com", role = "aut",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-9589-5748")),
    person("Novica", "Nakov", , "nnovica@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-7773-7718")),
    person("Discindo", role = "cph")
  )
Description: Build, test and deploy 'R' scripts as Amazon Web Services
    ('AWS') 'Lambda' functions packaged in 'Docker' container images.
    Images are built and tested locally, pushed to the 'AWS' Elastic
    Container Registry, and deployed with an execution role; deployed
    functions can be invoked, scheduled and deleted from 'R'. Wraps
    functionality from the 'paws' and 'lambdr' packages.
